     <h2 style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:11px;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">建党百年</span>|赓续百年红色基因 开创名校教育新局</span></strong></h2><h2 style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:11px;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">——绍兴一中各支部召开党史学习教育专题组织生活会</span></span></strong></h2><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">庆祝建党百年</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">7月8日，绍兴市第一中学各支部召开了以“赓续百年红色基因 开创名校教育新局”为主题的支部党史学习教育专题组织生活会。围绕对学史明理、学史增信、学史崇德、学史力行的理解感悟，围绕学党史、悟思想、办实事、开新局的目标要求，党员同志们纷纷敞开心扉，畅谈学习感悟，交流学习心得。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161359314372.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161359314372.JPG" /><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">在行政支部的专题组织生活会上，党委书记、校长王琛以普通党员身份参加，与党支部成员谈心交流。市教育局党史学习教育第一巡回指导组副组长钱金星莅临指导。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">会前准备</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">根据绍兴市党史学习教育领导小组办公室下发的文件要求，我校党委班子高度重视，积极召开相关筹备会议，扎实做好了认真组织学习、深入谈心谈话、广泛征求意见等三方面会前准备工作，为开好学习教育专题组织生活会打好基础。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">会议议程</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">01</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">重温入党誓词</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161359584168.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161359584168.jpg" /><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"> </span></strong><span style="font-family: "Microsoft YaHei UI"; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: justify;">02</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">开展《党章》专题学习</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: left;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161400378065.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161400378065.JPG" /><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span><span style="font-family: "Microsoft YaHei UI"; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: justify;">03</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">支部书记汇报工作情况</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161401221026.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161401221026.JPG" /></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">支部书记朱水军代表行政支部汇报了</span>2021年上半年开展党史学习教育的工作情况，并就联系服务党员群众、力戒形式主义官僚主义等方面进行盘点检视。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">04</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">党员围绕四个方面盘点检视</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: "Microsoft YaHei UI"; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0px;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161402058519.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161402058519.JPG" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161402062018.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161402062018.JPG" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161402074063.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161402074063.JPG" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161402077575.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161402077575.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">随后，各位党员同志围绕学习习近平总书记在庆祝中国共产党成立</span>100周年大会上的重要讲话，重点结合《习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想简史学习》和《中国共产党简史》学习资料谈党史学习情况和感悟收获，自身在坚定理想信念、增强历史自觉、弘扬优良传统、加强党性锤炼等方面的差距和不足，以及在发挥党员先锋模范作用、为群众办实事好事和立足岗位、履职尽责等四个方面作了自我盘点检视，开展了批评与自我批评。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">05</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">党委书记、校长王琛讲话</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161403159113.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161403159113.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(33, 32, 32);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">钱金星对行政支部的组织生活会进行了点评。通过听取大家的发言，他认为本次组织生活会准备充分、主题鲜明、程序规范、检视到位，各方面工作扎实有效，开得很成功也很有成效，并对绍兴一中党委和行政支部党史学习教育工作和取得的成绩表示充分肯定和好评。具体来说，体现在如下三个方面。</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(33, 32, 32);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">一是方法多样，党史学习教育入脑入心。二是亮点鲜明，党史学习教育富有特色。三是学用结合，党史学习教育成果显著。</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(33, 32, 32);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">随后，他就今后的党史学习教育，提出了三点希望和要求。</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(33, 32, 32);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">一是要把握党史学习教育的重点内容。二是要做好党史学习教育存在的问题整改。三是要学用结合推动学校高水平特色发展。</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">其他各支部也在各自支部活动室召开党史学习教育专题组织生活会。</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">文科一支部</span></span></strong></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161404081353.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161404081353.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161404093048.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161404093048.jpg" /></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;"> </span>
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">文科二支部</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161405187909.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161405187909.jpg" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161405191894.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161405191894.JPG" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161405209837.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161405209837.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">理科一支部</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161406343379.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161406343379.JPG" /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161406343063.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161406343063.JPG" /></p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"></span>
</p><p><strong><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">理科二支</span></span></strong></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161407149666.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161407149666.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161407153889.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161407153889.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161407154853.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161407154853.JPG" /></p><p><strong style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)">竞赛支部</span></strong>
</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161407505857.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161407505857.png" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei UI';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei UI">在本次组织生活会中，党员同志们纷纷结合党史学习教育及本职工作进行了深刻剖析，并表示将以此为契机汲取奋进力量，在今后的教育实践中坚定理想信念，继续推动学校教育工作更上台阶。</span></span></p><p>
</p>
    
